senses.gloss:
रत्नम् + -अचलः, -रोहणः legendary mountain located in Ceylon and supposed
 to produce jewels at the rumbling of clouds for the benefit of all comers;
 श्रेणीवर्जनदुर्यशोनिबिडितव्रीडस्तु रत्नाचलः N. 12. 67.

